  "text": "Their guide led them to Founders' Bell, greened with age and suspended beneath a limestone arch. It had once called students to assembly, she explained. Now it rang at Opening Convocation and commencement, marking the entrance and exit of a McCall-Hart education. Nia looked up at it. Imagine hearing that on your last day here. Malik looked down Cypress Walk, where indigo banners shifted in the humid breeze. Four years seemed both enormous and dangerously brief.",
